                       were interpreted as "HOOK" and the "NONE" suboption was interpreted as "NOHOOK".  The "SYM" suboption is no   
                       longer required, "SYM" suboption behavior is always in effect with "TEST".                                    
                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                     
